	// hub on the same LAN or in the same datacentre answers in 200-900us, which
	// truncates to a millisecond value of 0 on every scrape -- the exact number
	// the schema declares impossible, since it would claim an instantaneous
	// connection. Worse, min and max would both be 0, so the jitter that is
	// half the reason for three handshakes could never be seen. Rounding does
	// not fix it; only resolution does.
	//
