// recovered while the agent was down (the restart baseline reports only FAILED
// units, so a recovery is silently skipped), the unit vanished from the bus
// entirely (`apt purge`, or reset-failed followed by systemd unloading it, and
// the collector only iterates units that still exist), or the scrape carrying
// the recovery was dropped by the ring. Each one pins a unit at "failed"
// forever. The snapshot is the level-triggered repair for all three: it says
